<title>DENMARK: Danish Feb wholesale prices up 1.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish Feb wholesale prices up 1.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices rose by 0.3 percent in February 1997 from January and were up 1.4 percent from February 1996, the national statistics office said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>					Feb 1997   Jan  1997   Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    +0.3	+0.1	 -0.1</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)     +1.4	+1.0	 +0.9</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)   104.9    104.6	103.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. Analysts had forecast an average 1.0 percent yr/yr WPI rise for February and a 0.1 percent fall on the month.</p>
</text>
